{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38938","headline":"戏赠渔家 · 杜荀鹤","name":"戏赠渔家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见君生计羡君闲，求食求衣有底难。\n养一箔蚕供钓线，种千茎竹作渔竿。\n葫芦杓酌春浓酒，舴艋舟流夜涨滩。\n却笑农家最辛苦，听蝉鞭马入长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}